  "repo_truth": "Review baseline is 8c16a90657a787e95d55c856fac3d8d45d9e68be. The integrated subject consists of committed checkpoints 5cf41d2f64d68cb7f78abb5eccab9acf307089d3 and 5a2ccf6939be0e549e7e7355a245c7511c271eef plus the live ten-path documentation/control-pack delta. The manifest excludes the eight unrelated pre-existing .claude/AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md changes. P2 has no approved condition-evidence/evaluator contract; P4/P5 have no approved generic coverage-token derivation selector; P6 has not begun and both HCM-2 bridge IDs remain live. Raw proof and command results are in the manifested packet proof files, including the final 273-test P3/P3B wall, complete workspace result, affected strict clippy/fmt/archive/diff checks, and pre-P3B-commit GitNexus LOW/zero-process result.",
