    "Confirm the exact maximum promotion: five package-admitted successor definition closures, shipped-root 1.2 with three instances, and the exact Work Specification Stage 10 real path.",
    "Confirm Environment Context, Decision/Risk positive mutation, P6 bridge deletion, Phase 2 exit, program-wide YAML closure, and HCM-3.x remain unearned.",
    "Verify the two committed checkpoint boundaries and live documentation delta preserve unrelated work and contain no transient fixture outputs."
  ],
