    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No P2 evaluator design, P4/P5 token-derivation design, P6 implementation, Phase 2 completion claim, or HCM-3.x work.",
    "No open-ended redesign of already packet-reviewed implementation; report only demonstrated P1/P2 effects on the integrated selected outcome, with P3/P4 for useful non-blocking coverage or wording.",
    "Do not compare against or adopt conclusions from prior reviewers before independently identifying findings."
  ],
